WEBVTT

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.550
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.320
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.100
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.830
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.540
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.120
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.330
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.270
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.040
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.730
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.510
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.230
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.840
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.490
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.360
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.080
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.760
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.370
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.140
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.600
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.490
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.800
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:36.950
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.760
Hey!

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:54.910
Wait up!

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:04.140
Holy Crown!

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.930
Juggling Party!

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:26.830
It's coming, Joker.

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:27.890
Okay.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.870
All according to plan.

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:40.390
Go, Amu-chan!

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:43.560
Colorful Canvas!

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.970
Negative Heart:

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:50.990
Lock On!

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:58.180
Open Heart!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:04.930
We got it!

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:15.890
You did it, Amu-chan!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.890
Just as planned.

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.030
Hm? Kairi?

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:27.220
I Can't Help But Fall in Love!

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:27.220
Episode 33

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.850
After summing up all the data to yesterday,

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:36.420
our rate of capturing X Eggs has doubled compared to last month.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.600
That's quite an amazing achievement!

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:43.660
It's because Rima-tan's helping out!

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:44.740
Not really.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.140
But I believe that Sanjo-kun has accomplished a great deal.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:51.450
We're much more efficient and effective!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.850
He's like a super reliable advisor!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.610
Y-You give me too much credit.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.720
Please don't flatter me so much.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:03:59.850
Here.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.590
What is this?

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.520
Your reward.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:04.970
Joker.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:08.180
Thank you very much.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.210
I'll give you rice crackers, too!

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:13.080
Well, how about some Japanese tea I made?

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:15.430
I-I appreciate it.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.100
Sanjo-kun.

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:21.020
It appears you're having a difficult time getting your hands on the Embryo.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.890
Will you be able to handle it?

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.940
Meaning what?

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:28.560
Are those Seiyo Elementary kids continuing to interfere?

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:31.830
I'm asking if you'll be able to handle them.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.150
You needn't be concerned.

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:36.890
The project is progressing smoothly.

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:39.960
If you wait a little longer...

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.890
So I can trust you, right?

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:47.400
You can rest assured, Director.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:50.600
I shall deliver the Embryo to the Boss.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.880
What are you thinking about, Kairi?

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.520
How to make the capture of X Eggs more efficient.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.430
Do not forget your position, Kairi.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.020
I-I know that.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:10.300
Okay?

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.660
Just gather information and learn the Guardians' secrets!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:16.020
Especially regarding Hinamori Amu.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:19.720
Do not take your eyes off of her!

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.170
I haven't forgotten.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.870
My role is to...

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:25.810
It's Kairi and Musashi!

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.140
You go home this way, too, Chairman?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.640
Y-Yes.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:33.660
Hey, hey.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.580
Show us a technique or something!

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.620
The sword is a warrior's life.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.160
It cannot be drawn without reason.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:41.330
Why not?

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:43.770
Come on, man among men!

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.560
Flattery will not help.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:51.560
Hello?

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.630
What's wrong, Chairman?

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:55.190
Is something on your mind?

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.850
N-No, nothing.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.120
Why do you ask?

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.220
No reason, but I'm glad to hear it.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:05.780
But if something comes up, you shouldn't force yourself to deal with it alone.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.270
You have all of the Guardians.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:11.390
They're always saving me.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:13.350
Joker.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.110
Come on, girls.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:16.450
We should get going.

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:18.060
Okay!

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.850
I'm home!

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:32.730
Are you drunk, Sister?

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:34.680
Not at all!

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:36.950
Man!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:40.850
That old Director's so persistent and annoying!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.640
Haven't you found the Embryo yet?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.930
Like it's going to be that easy!

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:48.290
Sister, would you like dinner?

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.770
Or perhaps a bath?

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:51.600
I recorded the TV show you wanted.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:54.600
In high quality, as you requested.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.210
I'll take some water for now.

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:57.990
Okay.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:02.930
Kairi, you're doing your job, right?

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:07.470
Yes, of course.

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.350
What a messy sister.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:19.870
She makes you do all the chores, and now this.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.310
She can't help it.

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:23.020
I'm sure her job is hard.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.560
Kairi.

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:27.980
Work hard.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:29.850
Sister.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.890
Stupid Director.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:38.270
She's quite a deplorable sister.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.710
Today's lucky color is pink!

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:44.470
Something good might happen!

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:46.810
Hinamori-san!

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:48.160
Tadase-kun.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.310
Are you free on Sunday?

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:51.130
Huh?

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:53.130
I don't have any plans.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:53.680
I see.

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:56.970
If you don't mind, would you go out with me tomorrow?

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:57.920
Huh?

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:58.750
What?

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.150
My horoscope was spot on?

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:02.140
He's inviting me on a date?!

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.290
I need to go buy some equipment for the Guardians.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.780
I forgot something last time.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:08.120
Oh.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.890
Guess it couldn't have been a date.

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:13.650
But it's a chance to go out with the prince all by myself!

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:14.770
Can you come?

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:17.240
I'll go! I'll go!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.940
Th-That could be arranged.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:21.180
Here we go again.

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.240
Really?

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:23.460
That's a relief.

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:26.200
Then let's decide where to meet up.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:29.310
Ah, man!

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.970
Which one should I go with?

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.320
This is nothing new. You really like to worry about this, huh?

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.930
Why don't you try on a few?

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:40.050
Right.

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:43.100
It's Miki's fashion check!

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.640
Number one!

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.330
Looks good! Looks good!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.310
It's cute, but something's off.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.330
Number two!

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.180
This is cute, too!

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.500
It's safe, but it's missing something.

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:59.240
Number three!

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.170
Go with this! Go with this!

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.450
Jeez.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.790
How's this?

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:05.960
This?

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:07.000
This?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.000
This?

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.300
Amu-chan, how about this one?

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:13.930
Th-That's...

00:09:18.690 --> 00:09:21.380
You look super cute, Amu-chan!

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:25.810
But if I wear this, he'll be turned off by how hard I'm trying!

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.110
It's love.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:28.960
El.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.590
I can't let this romantic event just go by.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:34.200
It'd be a shot to my pride as an angel character!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:37.800
I'll be conducting a full report tomorrow.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.240
What?

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:41.300
Watch the house for us.

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:44.220
It'll turn into a huge mess if you come.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.720
The same goes for you guys.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:48.770
We are definitely going.

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.750
Hang in there, Amu-chan!

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.800
But I'm so nervous.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:00.600
Hinamori-san!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:04.220
Sorry for the wait, Hinamori-san!

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:06.390
Way cute!

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:08.250
Sorry for the wait.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:11.120
I-I-I barely waited at all!

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.200
Really?

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.270
That's a relief.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:16.720
It's too bad this isn't a date.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.460
But I'm still alone with the prince!

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:21.110
I'm gonna take a bunch of pictures!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.780
Amu-chan.

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:26.470
The heroine is secretly taking pictures?

00:10:26.470 --> 00:10:29.030
I'm pretty sure that slips ever so slightly into the unacceptable category.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:31.730
Hinamori Amu is a pervert.

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:34.640
Huh?

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:36.850
Come on, let's go, Hinamori-san!

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:40.630
Th-This is...

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:49.750
So boring-nya.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.080
Yeah.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.290
Wanna play a word game?

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.540
I'll pass.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:55.600
Figured so-nya.

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:01.270
It's really crowded.

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.540
Take care not to get separated.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:04.420
Uh-huh.

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:09.210
If we bring this flyer, we can get a ball pen!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.210
Let's take a look over there.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.970
There isn't much of a mood,

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:18.940
but I'm still so happy!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.600
Honestly.

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.320
Why must a warrior skulk about like this?

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:28.560
We have no choice.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:29.830
This is our mission.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.940
Besides, Yukari-neesan said that...

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:34.420
A day off is the perfect chance for finding weaknesses.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.700
Do not take your eyes off of her!

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:38.300
So I'm keeping my eyes...

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:41.810
I don't think that's what she meant.

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.810
Besides...

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.950
What's with that getup?

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.830
Why aren't you wearing your glasses?

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.630
B-Because I'm in disguise.

00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:52.020
These clothes are in the image of a ninja.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.560
Can't you tell?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:56.190
So you start from the surface?

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.810
That's a cute store.

00:12:19.180 --> 00:12:20.760
Want to have a look?

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:23.140
But we have to finish shopping.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:24.420
I'd like to browse inside.

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:25.680
Would you come with me?

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:29.070
They're looking good together!

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:30.500
Hotori Tadase.

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:34.190
Has a cute face and is adept at taking the lead.

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.560
Why are you taking notes?

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:41.640
It's cute.

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:45.520
Don't frighten me, fools!

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:50.180
So many cute things.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:53.560
This wristband is totally adorable.

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:57.020
It'd probably go well with my usual outfit.

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:58.370
What should I do, though?

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:01.390
I want a new barrette, too.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:08.900
Hinamori-san, look at this.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.010
What is it, Tadase-kun?

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.360
I knew it.

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:18.810
It looks really cute on you.

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:23.230
N-No way!

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:25.720
This girly thing doesn't suit me!

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:26.790
Excuse me!

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:27.890
I'd like this please!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.450
Ta-Ta-Tadase-kun?

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:32.110
Thank you very much!

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:33.560
After them, Kairi!

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.770
Y-Yeah.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.890
Amu-chan, Ran and the others are gone.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:48.800
Did they ditch me?

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.690
How could they forget about me?

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:52.660
That's going too far!

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:53.980
Kairi, hurry up!

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:54.680
Yeah.

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:57.760
You're...

00:13:57.760 --> 00:13:59.400
That was dangerous!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.300
Watch where you're go-

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.440
Why if it isn't Kairi-kun!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.900
What a surprise to run into you here.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.410
I'm in a hurry, so if you'll excuse me.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:09.890
Wait!

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:12.390
Wh-What is it?

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:15.100
Something's fishy here.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:17.260
You're dressed differently.

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:19.950
And you appear to be sneaking around.

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:21.500
She's surprisingly sharp.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:25.310
This bag is from that fancy shop!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:26.820
Here it comes!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:28.460
The love flag!

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:31.160
When there is love, it's time for the angel character, El!

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:34.360
I'll make your love come true!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.540
We've run into a real pain.

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:36.050
Love! Love!

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:37.850
Love Angel!

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:39.020
Yeah.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.020
El! El!

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.060
Sorry to keep you waiting, Hinamori-san.

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:44.380
Chocolate or vanilla?

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:45.600
It's your choice.

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.210
Um...

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.470
I'll take chocolate, then.

00:14:49.470 --> 00:14:51.140
Okay, I'll take vanilla.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:52.440
I'm so happy.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:54.270
I love vanilla.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.100
So cute!

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:57.500
U-Um...

00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.110
Thanks for buying me this, too.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:00.640
Does it honestly look good on me?

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:03.190
Yep, it's wonderful.

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:04.640
Enough to make my heart pound.

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:05.890
Huh?

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.390
He's a natural playboy.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:12.470
I've been thinking about it for a while, and I have to agree.

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:13.420
No way.

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:14.770
Even you, Kiseki?

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:16.310
I just...

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:19.950
I just thought she looks as wonderful as Amulet Heart.

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.560
Yay!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:23.330
Oh, that's why.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:26.300
I'm my own rival in love?

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:30.270
It'll leave a stain!

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:32.190
I'll go wet my handkerchief.

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.390
I-It's okay. It's no big deal.

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:36.160
I'll be right back.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.890
Hold this for me.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:43.470
The prince is so kind!

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:45.710
He really is a natural playboy.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.980
Love flags are popping up all over the place!

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:49.760
Wait.

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:51.130
El's gone.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:58.920
She appears to be spontaneously going in no particular direction.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:01.070
How long do you intend to follow her?

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:02.500
We have no choice.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.850
One wrong move and she'll suspect us.

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:06.930
Perhaps so, however...

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:09.820
We must find the Joker and the others without delay.

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.430
I can't see very well.

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:15.400
That's why I told you to put on your glasses.

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:16.790
Oh!

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.890
Did you get a reading on your love radar?

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:21.470
Where is the target of your love?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.610
Her?

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:24.970
Is she the one?

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:27.310
Target: Lock On!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:31.810
I'll let her have a taste of my special love attack!

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:32.760
Come, Amu-chan!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.020
Character Transformation!

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:34.500
Huh?

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.060
What are you doing?

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:37.990
Character Transformation, Am-

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.490
Oh, that's right.

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:42.020
They all ditched me.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:43.920
I can't dawdle around here!

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:46.160
I must find Amu-chan!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.030
Amu-chan!

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:49.950
She really marches to her own beat.

00:16:49.950 --> 00:16:50.980
Yeah.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:54.930
The prince's partially eaten ice cream...

00:16:55.220 --> 00:16:56.320
Amu-chan.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:58.350
Look, don't touch.

00:16:58.350 --> 00:17:00.650
She's completely out of it.

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:02.430
Oh, but this one's...

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:07.430
H-H-He snuck up on me!

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:08.340
Yo.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.130
Yo.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.270
Wh-When did you...

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:12.390
You have absolutely no presence!

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:13.610
You know...

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:16.160
You'll get fat if you eat both of those ice cream cones.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.030
I wa-

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:18.470
This one's Tadase-kun's.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.150
Tadase's?

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:25.340
Wh-What is it?

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:26.540
I'm not giving you any.

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:29.350
I also like...

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:30.350
Huh?

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:31.720
Chocolate ice cream.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:34.950
Expecting something else?

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:35.830
Get real!

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:36.970
Get lost! Shoo!

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.700
You always tease me like that.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.080
I totally don't get you.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.930
Just leave me alone already.

00:17:43.230 --> 00:17:44.720
I can't.

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.430
You're always on my mind.

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.220
Again?!

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:56.380
Seriously, you're so much fun to tease.

00:17:57.060 --> 00:17:58.670
Now I'm mad!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.180
Huh?

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.350
Hinamori-san!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:07.850
Sorry, I had a hard time finding a water fountain.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.060
Ta-Tadase-kun.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.680
Tsu-Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.130
What are you doing?

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:16.930
Let go of Hinamori-san!

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:19.290
She jumped into my arms.

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:21.270
I did not! I just fell!

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:25.100
And what... You still like vanilla?

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.020
Wha-

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:29.850
Your sense of taste is as childish as ever.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:31.690
The ice cream's dripping!

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.030
Amu, you take that side.

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:33.600
What?

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:35.300
Nice catch.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.720
Shoot, I moved by reflex.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.130
The prince's ice cream...

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.850
It's an indirect kiss!

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.330
I don't think that's the issue anymore.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.640
You don't care, Tadase?

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:50.100
I'm going to eat your dear vanilla ice cream <i>and</i> Amu.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:52.520
Kiseki!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.140
Yes!

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:56.770
I will no longer let you have your way, you thieving cat!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:00.550
You ate vanilla ice cream a lot when you were a kid.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.600
While sitting in your big brother's lap.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:04.020
Sh-Shut up!

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:07.100
Why do you keep trying to get close to Hinamori-san?

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:08.670
Like I said...

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:11.140
My mood changes with my tail.

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:12.310
Holy Crown!

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:12.720
Huh?

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:14.540
Wait!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:15.710
No way.

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:17.370
That's cheap, you thieving cat!

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:18.640
Um...

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:21.470
Ah, I found her!

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:22.930
Amu-chan sighted!

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:25.770
What is this?

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:29.390
This is what you would call a battle for Amu-chan's love!

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:31.280
It's my turn now!

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:35.060
Man, those two.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.000
Amu-chan, Character Transform!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.510
El, where did you go?

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:40.110
Stop dawdling!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:42.760
Now is the time for the heroine to take the stage!

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:43.550
Huh?

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:44.750
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:47.070
Besides, you can't just conveniently...

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:49.450
Character Transform.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.910
Amu-chan's heart: Unlock!

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.390
What?!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.250
Wh-What?!

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.380
What's going on here?!

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:03.270
Time for the heroine to take the stage.

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:05.220
You... You're kidding me.

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:10.030
Character Transformation: Amulet Angel!

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:12.350
I'll handle anything to do with love!

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:17.460
They Character Transformed.

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:19.350
They sure did.

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:21.470
I-Is this even possible?

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:23.490
You can do whatever you put your mind to.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.980
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:25.600
Huh?

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:28.390
Angel Wink!

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:34.990
Hey, El!

00:20:34.990 --> 00:20:36.260
What was that just now?

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:38.020
What was it, indeed.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:38.790
Huh?

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:40.960
She wasted a precious Character Transformation.

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:43.020
For something like this.

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:46.680
Don't laugh!

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:48.500
Don't ask the impossible.

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:50.260
Wait, Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:20:50.740 --> 00:20:52.180
Wait!

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:58.100
Tadase-kun and Ikuto aren't coming back.

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:00.110
Amu was dumped.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:07.350
What is it, Kairi?

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.400
Joker.

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:12.680
Chairman.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.600
Huh? You're not wearing glasses?

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:17.440
I-I happened to be passing by,

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:20.180
and you looked troubled.

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:22.880
Yeah, kind of.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:25.020
A-Also...

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.390
Here.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:29.520
Oh, this is...

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:33.400
I-I also spotted this along the way.

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:36.220
A-And I thought it might suit you.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:39.810
You gave me a strawberry as a reward yesterday, so...

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:41.140
For me?

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:41.760
Really?

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:43.360
I wanted this!

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:44.310
Thanks!

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:47.310
Isn't that wonderful, Amu-chan?

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:48.660
It looks great!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:49.390
Think so?

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:50.520
Thanks!

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:54.970
The heart hair accessory looks pretty,

00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:58.340
but I prefer you the way you are.

00:21:58.770 --> 00:21:59.810
Huh?

00:22:00.650 --> 00:22:01.850
Kairi.

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:03.880
Hey!

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:05.670
Come down, you coward!

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:08.750
You still can't climb trees, huh?

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:14.160
Ikuto's having fun, so all's well that ends well-nya.

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.600
I object!

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.210
We're...

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:20.060
Not satisfied either.

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.130
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.510
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:50.810
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.050
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.000
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.330
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:05.890
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.660
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.270
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.640
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.550
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.800
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.800
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.050
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:35.030
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:39.730
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:49.210
{blurb}I'm number one today, of course!

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:52.310
Could everyone listen to me?

00:23:52.310 --> 00:23:54.930
Lately, there've been rumors spreading about a ghost.

00:23:54.930 --> 00:23:56.560
A ghost?

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:57.660
I want its autograph!

00:23:57.660 --> 00:23:58.530
That's dumb.

00:23:58.530 --> 00:24:00.760
We should discover the ghost's identity-dechu!

00:24:00.760 --> 00:24:03.820
So we'll be investigating a haunted house this time.

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:04.390
Huh?

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:05.850
What's wrong, Hinamori-san?

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:06.910
Not a chance!

00:24:06.910 --> 00:24:09.770
I can't stand ghosts!

00:24:09.770 --> 00:24:11.250
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:13.730
Seriously!? Big Haunted House Adventure!

00:24:13.730 --> 00:24:15.070
Fight, Amu-chan!

00:24:15.070 --> 00:24:16.440
I can't do it!

00:24:16.440 --> 00:24:20.060
Amu-chan doesn't like scary stuff.
